meta {
  name: getWebHooks
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getWebHooks",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve all registered webhooks (credentials omitted)

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |

  **Example: List webhooks**. Credentials (password) are never returned.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getWebHooks",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "web_hooks": [
      {
        "web_hook_id": 1,
        "external_web_hook_id": "my-hook",
        "web_hook_url": "https://example.com/hook",
        "web_hook_headers": [],
        "auth_type": null,
        "username": null,
        "entity_names": [
          "product"
        ],
        "is_active": true,
        "is_editable": true
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 1,
      "items_per_page": 100,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
